! INET(インターネット中継)
interface Ethernet0/0
 description to ISP-A
 ip address 198.51.100.250 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
interface Ethernet0/1
 description to ISP-B
 ip address 203.0.113.250 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
interface Ethernet0/2
 description INET segment (INET-SV)
 ip address 192.0.2.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
ip route 198.51.100.0 255.255.255.0 198.51.100.249
ip route 203.0.113.0 255.255.255.0 203.0.113.249
ip access-list extended PMTU-BLACKHOLE
 deny icmp any any packet-too-big
 permit ip any any
ntp master 3
